  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom decor with this personalized Baseball Comforter Set from Jeminise, perfect for any baseball player or fan. This set combines comfort with a passion for the game, making it an ideal gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin, Full, Queen, and King to fit various beds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques for fade-resistant colors and smooth, compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with microfiber filling, ensuring a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent present for men, women, moms, dads, and perfect for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover for your convenience.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
